<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 95,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 95,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's est hog receipts 95,000, Wk ago 99,000, and Yr ago 104,000 head at interior Iowa Minnesota. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded steady compared with mid-session Friday. Trade was slow for moderate demand and light offerings. Top $58.50 per cwt.</p>
